                                "sense_id": "b5476087-2b86-3a37-baf4-fa918a8db180",
                                "text": "This pressure brought the Southern slavocracy into conflict with Northern business interests. Slaveowners precipitated a war to defend the slave system and its accompanying way of life."
                            },
